136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E (College students often rely on multiple disconnected channels such as notice boards, messaging groups, social media, emails, and informal communication to stay updated about campus activities. This makes it difficult for students to discover important announcements, participate in college events, find clubs, connect with other students, and access relevant campus information from a single platform. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
